    "text": "<p>Match <strong>List <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math></strong> with <strong>List</strong> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math>.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>&nbsp;(Monomer Unit)</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math>&nbsp;(Polymer)</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(a)</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;Caprolactum</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(i)</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;Natural rubber</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(b)</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></math>Chloro<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></math>butadiene</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;Buna<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(c)</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;Isoprene</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;Nylon <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(d)</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;Acrylonitrile</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;Neoprene</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
